{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46429","headline":"酬元员外见寄八韵 · 齐己","name":"酬元员外见寄八韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧隐梦牵仍，归心只似蒸。\n远青怜岛峭，轻白爱云腾。\n艳冶丛翻蝶，腥膻地聚蝇。\n雨声连洒竹，诗兴继填膺。\n访戴情弥切，依刘力不胜。\n衆人忘苦苦，独自媿兢兢。\n处世无他望，流年有病僧。\n时慙大雅客，遗韵许相承。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46429.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46429","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}